{"title":"Moots Teases Routt Gravel Bike Update with 57mm Tire Clearance, Consolidated Lineup","link":"https://bikerumor.com/moots-teases-routt-gravel-bike-update-with-57mm-tire-clearance-consolidated-lineup/","date":1788547585000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype9.jpeg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" alt=\"Moots Routt teaser 57mm tire clearance 2027\" /></p>\n<p>You might have already seen the two Moots prototypes in our <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/32-bike-mega-roundup-pt-1-all-the-flat-bar-builds-we-could-find-at-made/\" target=\"_blank\">32″ roundup</a>, but they had another bike on hand at MADE that is likely even more exciting to many riders. The Moots Routt has been a popular gravel bike for the legendary titanium brand, but the current lineup has gotten a little confusing with all of the different models. Also, the biggest tire clearance you’ll find in the Routt lineup is 50mm, which puts it a bit behind the curve with gravel tires that are trending bigger and bigger. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>With the next generation of the Routt, Moots not only plans to address the tire clearance concerns, but will consolidate the lineup into a single model (for now). That’s right, there will soon be only one Routt model, which means the end of the YBB soft tail option. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype3.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype3.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots Routt teaser 57mm tire clearance 2027\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype3.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype3-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype3-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype3-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype3-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype3-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype4.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype4.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots Routt teaser 57mm tire clearance 2027\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype4.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype4-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype4-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype4-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype4-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype4-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype5.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype5.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots Routt teaser 57mm tire clearance 2027\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype5.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype5-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype5-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype5-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype5-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype5-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype6.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype6.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots Routt teaser 57mm tire clearance 2027\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype6.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype6-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype6-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype6-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype6-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype6-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype7.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype7.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots Routt teaser 57mm tire clearance 2027\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype7.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype7-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype7-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype7-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype7-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype7-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype2.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype2.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots Routt teaser 57mm tire clearance 2027\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype2.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype2-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype2-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype2-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype2-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype2-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype17.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype17.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots Routt teaser 57mm tire clearance 2027\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype17.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype17-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype17-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype17-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype17-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype17-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We’re told that the frame will soon fit up to a 57mm tire, though the geometry will be based around a 50mm tire as the ideal setup. While some current Routts can fit up to a 50mm tire, their geometry was optimized for a 45mm tire. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>The new Routt will use straight-gauge titanium currently used in the Routt 45, with a threaded BSA 68mm bottom bracket, 47.5mm chainline, and fender mounts standard. Moots is targeting a price of $9,500 for a SRAM Force build and plans to launch sometime this month. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Want the lighter double-butted tubing found on the RSL models? Moots hints that a new RSL model may be available in “early 2027.”</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>32″ Prototypes</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>As mentioned in the roundups, <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/32-mega-roundup-pt-2-all-the-drop-bar-builds-we-found-at-made/\" target=\"_blank\">Moots had two prototype 32″ bikes</a> on display with very little info about any possibilities. All we were told is that Moots COO Nathan Bradley has been testing one all summer, and that Moots is essentially waiting to see where the forks end up – a common thought for many frame builders out there currently. </p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Moots 32″ MTB Prototype</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype12.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype12.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots 32 prototype MTB\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype12.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype12-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype12-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype12-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype12-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype12-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype11.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype11.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots 32 prototype MTB\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype11.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype11-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype11-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype11-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype11-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype11-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype10.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype10.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots 32 prototype MTB\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype10.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype10-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype10-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype10-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype10-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype10-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype13.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype13.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots 32 prototype MTB\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploa