ototype15.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype15.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots 32 prototype gravel\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype15.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype15-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype15-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype15-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype15-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype15-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Womble</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype1.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype1.jpeg\" alt=\"Moots Womble\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype1.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype1-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype1-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype1-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype1-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Moots-Routt-55mm-tire-clearance-MADE-2026-32-prototype1-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Just before the show, <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/moots-new-womble-is-a-shredable-modern-titanium-hardtail-and-quite-the-looker-too/\" target=\"_blank\">Moots announced updates to their Womble MTB frame</a> as well. Similar to the Routt, the MTB lineup will see a consolidation, likely with just two models – the recently updated Routt, and some kind of endurance XC frame that will be added in early 2027. </p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://moots.com/\" target=\"_blank\">moots.com</a></em></p>","author":"Zach Overholt","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/moots-teases-routt-gravel-bike-update-with-57mm-tire-clearance-consolidated-lineup/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"21c0d3fea66467a9e03599b940651f4a601dfd9249552a57eff6ee01e3d35933","category":"Cycling"}